  - m_Id: 662229213371
    m_Localized: Irrigation Patrol
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 662229213372
    m_Localized: "# Start at each plot\nwhile True:\n    for row in range(size()):\n       
      for col in range(size()):\n            if ready():\n                harvest()\n           
      if crop() == empty:\n                plant(grain)\n            move(East)\n       
      move(North)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 662229213373
    m_Localized: "Verdant Circuit uses a limited farm language inspired by Python.
      It only controls the game; it does not access your files or the network.\n\nACTIONS\nmove(East)
      / move(West) / move(North) / move(South)\nCrossing a field edge wraps to the
      opposite side.\nplant(grain) / harvest() / till() / water() / fertilize()\nwait(3)
      waits for 3 game seconds; print(value) writes to the log.\n\nSENSORS\nready():
      whether the current crop is mature\ncrop(): current crop, or empty\nmoisture()
      / fertility(): values from 0 to 1\nx() / y(): zero-based robot coordinates\nsize():
      field width; energy(): stored energy\ncount(grain): current grain stock; money():
      coins\nneighbors(pumpkin): matching crops in four adjacent plots\n\nSYNTAX\nIndent
      with four spaces. Supports # comments, variables, + - * / %, comparisons, and/or/not,
      if/elif/else, while, for ... in range(...), repeat, no-argument functions,
      break, continue and return.\nrange() accepts 1 to 3 integer arguments. Functions
      nest up to 24 calls.\n\nif ready():\n    harvest()\nelse:\n    wait(1)\n\nCROP
      IDS\nGrain: grain / Radish: radish / Blue flax: flax\nBlueberry: berry / Sunflower:
      sunflower / Pumpkin: pumpkin\nCloud tea: tea / Starbloom: starbloom\n\nEDITOR
      AND DEBUGGING\nUndo/redo up to 100 edits per program in this session: Ctrl/Cmd+Z
      and Ctrl/Cmd+Shift+Z (or Ctrl+Y).\nAdd or delete programs in Programs; keep
      at least one. Viewing another program does not stop the current one. Run replaces
      the active program.\nSyntax and runtime errors show their original source line.
      Pause and Step help inspect execution. Stop keeps all farm progress. Programs
      stop safely after 500000 instructions; empty loops yield between frames.\n\nPROGRESS\nCrop
      contracts count harvests after accepting that contract. Each crop has a different
      quantity target; there is no timer requirement. Earlier stock does not skip
      later crop contracts.\nOther contracts use cumulative progress. Claim rewards
      to advance; every five contracts opens a chapter. Research costs coins and
      knowledge. Free farming remains available after the campaign.\n\nSAVE\nThe
      farm and program list save every 30 real seconds and on exit. Manual saving
      keeps the previous backup. Trials use a separate temporary farm and restore
      the campaign afterward.\n\nLANGUAGE\nThe first launch uses English. Switch
      English / Chinese in Settings; the choice is remembered. Existing player code
      is never translated."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
